        "line": 32,
        "text": "For the right-action convention of [[def-finite-semisimple-module-category-over-fusion-category]], apply this definition to $\\mathcal C^{\\mathrm{rev}}$ and reverse the variable list: $M_X(m)=m\\odot X$, and the action comparison is $M_YM_X\\to M_{X\\otimes Y}$. In particular degree two is the space of natural endomorphisms of $(X,Y)\\mapsto M_YM_X$, after transporting through the fixed action comparisons."
